{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53641","headline":"拨櫂歌 二 · 德诚","name":"拨櫂歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来（《嘉禾志》作「二十余年」）江（《五灯会元》作「海」）上游，水清鱼见不吞钩。\n钓竿斫尽重栽竹，不计工夫（《五灯会元》作「功程」，《嘉禾志》作「工程」）得便休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}